# WordPress core & third-party installs are NOT versioned here.
# Only our authored theme (wp-content/themes/visati) and plugin
# (wp-content/plugins/visati-core) are tracked.

# Build artifacts inside our theme/plugin
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Tailwind / composer lock files (keep or track per-tooling decision later)
# **/package-lock.json
# **/composer.lock

# OS / editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
